  "details": "Encountered while trying to make a pigtail length slider for my avatar. Occurs on the previous few Live versions. (Pre-1490, will have to test this version as it just released)\n\nIt seems that scaling down part of a physbone chain and then moving can cause the end bones to stretch out really far over a short time when scaled to around 0.5.\n\nEventually they stretch far enough to crash the Android platform. I've not seen a crash on PC nor this weird stretching behaviour, however I only tested the PC side a rather long time ago.\n\nMy physbone settings include having Max Stretch set to Infinity, and I believe this is likely the problem as stretch is then uncapped, though Stretch Motion is zero so they shouldn't be stretching unless grabbed. Perhaps adding a hard cap to the stretch value at least on Android would be a potential solution.",
